  "short_description": "《Japanese Ramen Simulator》是一款最多支援六人遊玩的拉麵店經營模擬遊戲。準備食材、煮麵、擺放配料，製作講究的一碗。開發原創菜色，自由設計廚房與用餐區。無論與朋友合作還是獨自經營，都朝理想中的人氣拉麵店邁進！",
  "short_description_en": "Japanese Ramen Simulator is a ramen shop management sim for up to six players. Prepare ingredients, cook noodles, and arrange toppings to craft the perfect bowl. Create original dishes, design your kitchen and dining area, and build your ramen restaurant with friends or on your own!",
